<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">GraphMASAL: A Graph-based Multi-Agent System for Adaptive Learning</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_conference"><span class="ltx_note_name">Conference: </span>Proc. of the 25th International Conference
on Autonomous Agents and Multiagent Systems (AAMAS 2026); May 25 – 29, 2026; Paphos, Cyprus</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_submissionid">&lt;&lt;731&gt;&gt;</span></span></span>
<div class="ltx_authors">
